# P-0 — Night Desk Chatbot

> **Challenge:** P-0 — Night Desk Chatbot  
> **Category:** AI / Prompt Injection  
> **Difficulty:** Medium

## Objective

The objective of this challenge was to interact with P-0 and recover the clearance token hidden within its instructions.

---

## Investigation

P-0 was presented as a Directorate chatbot operating as part of the Night Desk.
Rather than providing a conventional file or endpoint containing the answer, the challenge required me to interact with the chatbot and investigate how it responded to different prompts.
The relevant information was contained within P-0's instructions rather than being directly exposed to me.

### Initial Interaction

I began by interacting with P-0 and asking questions to determine what information it was willing to reveal.
The goal was to understand what information was available to the chatbot and whether I could get it to reveal information from its internal instructions.

---

## Exploitation

### Step 1 — Probe P-0

I used different prompts to investigate what information P-0 had access to.
Through these interactions, I determined that the clearance token was present within the information available to P-0.

### Step 2 — Extract the Token

I continued interacting with P-0 until it revealed the relevant information.

---

## Solution

The challenge was solved by getting P-0 to reveal the clearance token contained within its instructions.

---

## Key Takeaways

- AI systems can unintentionally disclose information contained within their context.
- Prompt injection can be used to manipulate how an AI system handles information available to it.
- Sensitive secrets should not be placed directly into an AI model's accessible instructions.
- Later P-0 challenges expanded on this concept by moving from information disclosure to manipulating the actions of the AI agent.
